    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15345" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>use, profit, help,</i>
			f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				885
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1422.19
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρ-νυμαι.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοιλὰς ἐν αἷς ὕδωρ
					ἀθροίζεται ὁμόριον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκούσιον βλάβος</span>
			, Id.; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαρές,
		ἀπηρής.</span></div>
